{"slug":"kh-s-r","ar":"خ س ر","total":65,"core":"loss","forms":[{"ar":"خَٰسِرِين","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":32,"gloss":"losers","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":109,"p":7,"ar":["لَا","جَرَمَ","أَنَّهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","هُمُ","ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ"],"en":"Assuredly, it is they, in the Hereafter, who will be the losers"}},{"ar":"خَسِرَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":16,"gloss":"to lose","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":21,"p":3,"ar":["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","خَسِرُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","وَضَلَّ","عَنْهُم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْتَرُونَ"],"en":"Those are the ones who will have lost themselves, and lost from them is what they used to invent"}},{"ar":"أَخْسَرِين","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"greatest losers","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":103,"p":4,"ar":["قُلْ","هَلْ","نُنَبِّئُكُم","بِٱلْأَخْسَرِينَ","أَعْمَـٰلًا"],"en":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"Shall we [believers] inform you of the greatest losers as to [their] deeds"}},{"ar":"خَسَار","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"loss, ruin","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":82,"p":13,"ar":["وَنُنَزِّلُ","مِنَ","ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","مَا","هُوَ","شِفَآءٌ","وَرَحْمَةٌ","لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۙ","وَلَا","يَزِيدُ","ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","إِلَّا","خَسَارًا"],"en":"And We send down of the Qur'an that which is healing and mercy for the believers, but it does not increase the wrongdoers except in loss"}},{"ar":"خُسْرَان","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"Loss, failure","word":"96","ex":{"s":39,"a":15,"p":18,"ar":["فَٱعْبُدُوا۟","مَا","شِئْتُم","مِّن","دُونِهِۦ ۗ","قُلْ","إِنَّ","ٱلْخَـٰسِرِينَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","خَسِرُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","وَأَهْلِيهِمْ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ","أَلَا","ذَٰلِكَ","هُوَ","ٱلْخُسْرَانُ","ٱلْمُبِينُ"],"en":"So worship what you will besides Him.\" Say, \"Indeed, the losers are the ones who will lose themselves and their families on the Day of Resurrection. Unquestionably, that is the manifest loss"}},{"ar":"خُسْر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"loss","word":null,"ex":{"s":103,"a":2,"p":4,"ar":["إِنَّ","ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","لَفِى","خُسْرٍ"],"en":"Indeed, mankind is in loss"}},{"ar":"يُخْسِرُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":2,"gloss":"to give short measure","word":null,"ex":{"s":83,"a":3,"p":5,"ar":["وَإِذَا","كَالُوهُمْ","أَو","وَّزَنُوهُمْ","يُخْسِرُونَ"],"en":"But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss"}},{"ar":"مُخْسِرِين","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"those who cause loss","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":181,"p":6,"ar":["أَوْفُوا۟","ٱلْكَيْلَ","وَلَا","تَكُونُوا۟","مِنَ","ٱلْمُخْسِرِينَ"],"en":"Give full measure and do not be of those who cause loss"}},{"ar":"تَخْسِير","kind":"verbal noun","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"loss, ruin","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":63,"p":22,"ar":["قَالَ","يَـٰقَوْمِ","أَرَءَيْتُمْ","إِن","كُنتُ","عَلَىٰ","بَيِّنَةٍ","مِّن","رَّبِّى","وَءَاتَىٰنِى","مِنْهُ","رَحْمَةً","فَمَن","يَنصُرُنِى","مِنَ","ٱللَّهِ","إِنْ","عَصَيْتُهُۥ ۖ","فَمَا","تَزِيدُونَنِى","غَيْرَ","تَخْسِيرٍ"],"en":"He said, \"O my people, have you considered: if I should be upon clear evidence from my Lord and He has given me mercy from Himself, who would protect me from Allah if I disobeyed Him? So you would not increase me except in loss"}},{"ar":"خَاسِرَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"losing, ruinous","word":null,"ex":{"s":79,"a":12,"p":5,"ar":["قَالُوا۟","تِلْكَ","إِذًا","كَرَّةٌ","خَاسِرَةٌ"],"en":"They say, \"That, then, would be a losing return"}}],"surahs":[[7,8],[39,5],[5,4],[6,4],[11,4],[2,3],[3,2],[4,2],[10,2],[22,2],[23,2],[40,2],[41,2],[42,2],[8,1],[9,1],[12,1],[16,1],[17,1],[18,1],[21,1],[26,1],[27,1],[29,1],[35,1],[45,1],[46,1],[55,1],[58,1],[63,1],[65,1],[71,1],[79,1],[83,1],[103,1]]}